    {
      "evidence_id": "EV-004",
      "source_file_instance_id": "58916308a3527d59",
      "page_number": 1,
      "printed_page_label": "1/2",
      "section": "reason",
      "section_raw": "Reason",
      "clause_path": null,
      "exact_quote": "A manufacturing discrepancy (lack of heat treatment) on a batch of the N°3 and N°4 hinge sleeves installed on Thrust Reverser Unit (TRU) was identified. Those parts are only installed on A330 aeroplanes equipped with Rolls-Royce (RR) Trent 700 engines. This condition, if not corrected, in case of a Fan Blade Off event due to high vibration level, could cause in-flight loss of some heavy components of the TRU, possibly resulting in injury to persons on the ground. As current hinge sleeves are not serialized, it is not possible to identify the TRU hinge sleeves which did not receive the heat treatment. For the reason described above, this AD requires identification and replacement of the affected TRU hinge sleeves.",
      "start_char": null,
      "end_char": null,
      "page_text_sha256": "2095fcf23b7de9be732ee4f3bb6f52dc48283436c3dd8a598f1da45322913d30",
      "bbox_normalized": null,
      "extraction_method": "native_text",
      "quality": "normalized_whitespace",
      "table_context": null,
      "annotation_note": null
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV-005",
      "source_file_instance_id": "58916308a3527d59",
      "page_number": 1,
      "printed_page_label": "1/2",
      "section": "cover",
      "section_raw": "Effective Date",
      "clause_path": null,
      "exact_quote": "Effective Date: 25 March 2014",
      "start_char": null,
      "end_char": null,
      "page_text_sha256": "2095fcf23b7de9be732ee4f3bb6f52dc48283436c3dd8a598f1da45322913d30",
      "bbox_normalized": null,
      "extraction_method": "native_text",
      "quality": "normalized_whitespace",
      "table_context": null,
      "annotation_note": null
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV-006",
      "source_file_instance_id": "58916308a3527d59",
      "page_number": 2,
      "printed_page_label": "2/2",
      "section": "required_actions_and_compliance_times",
      "section_raw": "Required Action(s) and Compliance Time(s)",
      "clause_path": "(1)",
      "exact_quote": "(1) Within 12 months after the effective date of this AD, identify and, if found to be affected, replace the hinge sleeves N°3 and N°4 of the TRU cowl door in accordance with the instructions of Airbus Service Bulletin (SB) A330-78-3021 Revision 01.",
      "start_char": null,
      "end_char": null,
      "page_text_sha256": "413f41489bc84a40fe815c4ad7b0548e9d2da4616002ea3c2f47aeba3f3b8f23",
      "bbox_normalized": null,
      "extraction_method": "native_text",
      "quality": "normalized_whitespace",
      "table_context": null,
      "annotation_note": null
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV-007",
      "source_file_instance_id": "58916308a3527d59",
      "page_number": 2,
      "printed_page_label": "2/2",
      "section": "credit",
      "section_raw": "Required Action(s) and Compliance Time(s)",
      "clause_path": "(2)",
      "exact_quote": "(2) Aeroplanes on which Airbus Modification 202463 has been embodied in production or aeroplanes modified in accordance with the instructions of Airbus SB A330-78-3021 at original issue, are compliant with the requirement of paragraph (1) of this AD.",
      "start_char": null,
      "end_char": null,
      "page_text_sha256": "413f41489bc84a40fe815c4ad7b0548e9d2da4616002ea3c2f47aeba3f3b8f23",
      "bbox_normalized": null,
      "extraction_method": "native_text",
      "quality": "normalized_whitespace",
      "table_context": null,
      "annotation_note": null
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV-008",
      "source_file_instance_id": "58916308a3527d59",
      "page_number": 2,
      "printed_page_label": "2/2",
      "section": "required_actions_and_compliance_times",
      "section_raw": "Required Action(s) and Compliance Time(s)",
      "clause_path": "(3)",
      "exact_quote": "(3) From the effective date of this AD, installation of a TRU is allowed, provided that, prior to installation, it is determined, in accordance with the instructions of Airbus SB A330-78-3021, that the cowl door hinge sleeves installed on the TRU are not affected by the requirements of this AD.",
      "start_char": null,
      "end_char": null,
      "page_text_sha256": "413f41489bc84a40fe815c4ad7b0548e9d2da4616002ea3c2f47aeba3f3b8f23",
